        "content": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I encountered a case where changing only the proof of a private theorem changes the exported .olean, causing ordinary downstream importers to rebuild.</p>\n<p>Minimal reproducer:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">expose</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- version 1</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">private</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">privateProof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- version 2</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">private</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">privateProof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>It seems at least on Lean v4.33.0 the two versions produce different olean files. Is this behavior intentional under the module system?</p>",
        "id": 620542918,
        "sender_full_name": "Tianjiao Nie",
        "timestamp": 1788243259
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks, this is definitely prior behavior that has not yet been adjusted to the module system and so it is good to hear when it becomes a problem. Could you please open an issue?</p>",
